---
description: Private workspace guidance and gitignored .local search (Grep/Glob are blind)
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the local workspace rules in @.github/instructions/local.instructions.md when handling `.local/` content, support inquiries, or private workspace context.

`.local/` is gitignored (`/.local/*`). `.cursorignore` `!.local/**` only helps indexing and @ mentions. Agent Grep and Glob still return zero results, even with an explicit `.local` path. Do not conclude the folder is empty. Use Read/Write with an explicit path, or Shell to list/search (`Get-ChildItem`, `Select-String`, `rg --no-ignore-vcs`).

To load `.local/.instructions/*.instructions.md`, extract YAML frontmatter with the commands in that file, then Read only the matches. Do not Read every instruction file up front.
